{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18794","headline":"秋江早发 · 刘禹锡","name":"秋江早发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻阴迎晓日，霞霁秋江明。\n草树含远思，襟怀有余清。\n凝睇万象起，郎吟孤愤平。\n渚鸿未矫翼，而我已遐征。\n因思市朝人，方听晨鸡鸣。\n昏昏恋衾枕，安见元气英。\n纳爽耳目变，玩奇筋骨轻。\n沧洲有奇趣，浩然吾将行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}